{
  "title": "Nourishing Italian Runner Beans Pesto Pasta",
  "description": "A citrusy and aerated Italian dish featuring runner beans in a pesto sauce, perfect for a monsoon evening, and friendly to Buddhist temple dietary preferences.",
  "cuisine": "Italian",
  "diet": [
